# attitude_trim_test.scn — validate the all-mode attitude trim against a steady wind
# 全モード姿勢トリム検証: 定常横風に対する平衡傾き
#
# 2026-09-19: the SILS start attitude was corrected (it used to be the MuJoCo
# identity quaternion, which is level but faces EAST because MuJoCo's world is
# ENU; it is now level-and-NORTH, matching the firmware's yaw=0 boot state).
# So at yaw=0 the craft's forward (FRD body X) now points NORTH = NED +x = wind
# component fx. A wind along fx is the HEAD/TAIL wind that PITCH trim cancels;
# a wind along fy (east) is a CROSS wind that ROLL trim cancels.
# The wind below is still on fy, so as written this scenario now exercises the
# ROLL axis. Measured after the fix (hover window [20,28] s): mean roll
# +0.0008 deg, mean pitch -0.0000 deg, drift on pos_y only. Re-point the wind to
# fx if a PITCH-trim test is what is wanted.
# 2026-09-19: SILS の初期姿勢を修正した（以前は MuJoCo の単位クォータニオン＝水平
# だが東向き。MuJoCo の世界が ENU のため。現在は「水平かつ北向き」で、ファームが
# yaw=0 で起動する状態と一致する）。よって yaw=0 で機体前方(FRD body X)は北＝NED +x
# ＝風成分 fx を向く。fx 方向の風が pitch トリムの打ち消すべき正面/背面風であり、
# fy（東）方向の風は roll トリムが打ち消すべき横風である。
# 下の風は依然 fy にあるため、現状この手順は roll 軸を動かす。修正後の実測
# （ホバー窓 [20,28]s）: 平均 roll +0.0008°、平均 pitch -0.0000°、ドリフトは pos_y のみ。
# pitch トリムの検証が目的なら風を fx へ振り直すこと。
#
# The wind is applied from t=0 (sustained) so trim and wind balance from the moment
# of takeoff. Injecting a boot-time pitch trim while there is NO wind tips the craft
# over during climb (it accelerates sideways and lands) — so the wind must be present
# throughout for a clean balance test.
# 風は t=0 から持続。起動時トリムを風が無い状態で入れると climb 中に横へ倒れて着地する
# ため、釣り合いを見るには風を常時与える。
#
# Run twice and compare the downwind drift in the hover window [20, 28] s. With
# the wind still on fy (east) this is truth.csv's pos_y and the ROLL trim axis:
#   (1) trim=0 (default):    drifts +pos_y (downwind, east)
#   (2) trim=+0.0552 (roll): SILS_EMU_PARAMS_FILE=/tmp/trim.txt -> holds pos_y
# 風が fy（東）のままなので、比較するのは truth.csv の pos_y、効くのは roll トリム。
# Steady wind 0.02 N east -> equilibrium pitch asin(0.02/(0.037*9.80665)) = 0.0552 rad.
#
#  <t>  ch    <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt>
   0    wind  0.0   0.008  0.0                                          # steady NED-east wind (body forward at yaw=0), sustained from t=0 (weak: eq tilt ~1.26 deg)
   0    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  0     13000     50              # A: disarmed 13 s (boot -> IDLE)
   +    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50              # B: ARM rising edge in IDLE
   +    rc    3106  2048   2048    2048  1     2600      50              # C: STABILIZE gentle take-off to ~0.62 m
   +    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  1     12000     50        1      # D: ALT_HOLD hover 12 s under wind (MEASURE px drift)
   +    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  1     2000      50        1      # E: settle 2 s
